ACPICA in Minkar
=================

contrib/dev/acpica is ACPICA 20250807 (Intel's ACPI Component
Architecture), as it was in this repository before "The Great Migration"
(commit 9d813c08ba^, sys/contrib/dev/acpica), used under the BSD-3 option
of its dual licence (see the header of each file). Only the interpreter is
kept: include/ and components/{dispatcher,events,executer,hardware,
namespace,parser,resources,tables,utilities}; components/resources/
rsdump.c (debugger support) is not built.

The ACPICA files are unmodified. Our files (BSD-2):

* include/platform/acmacosx.h - the environment for the Darwin kernel,
  which ACPICA's acenv.h includes on __APPLE__.
* ../ACPIOSLayer.cpp - the OS services ACPICA calls (AcpiOs*).
* ../ACPIInterpreter.cpp - starting ACPICA and what IOACPIFamily asks of
  it: PCI interrupt routing (_PRT, link devices), the SCI.
